  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Black Women&#x2019;s Blueprint&#x2019;s (BWB) mission is to foster human connection across differences and forge paths to peace, holistic reconciliation, and economic and environmental justice. Its work addresses the social determinants of health, enables land justice, creates space for collective healing and reconciliation, and fosters inclusive and sustainable organizational cultures. BWB aims to deepen these focal areas and build the infrastructure of the Restore Forward Cooperative, a co-created, vibrant, and safe community where women and all people can live lives of sovereignty and dignity. (Gender Equity and Governance)</narrative>
  </description>
